#
# The Tockmox UI's direct dependencies. The lockfile beside this one
# (requirements.txt) pins them and everything they pull in, with hashes, and
# the image installs from that file with --require-hashes, never from this one.
# A floor here is a statement of what the code needs; the lockfile is what
# ships. To change a pin, edit this file and regenerate the lockfile with the
# command written at the top of it (Renovate's pip-compile manager runs the
# same command). tools/requirements-gates.in includes this file, so the gates'
# lockfile resolves the same direct dependencies for the UI's tests.
